{"word":"καίριος","uri":"kairios","senses":[{"word":"καίριος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">καίριος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">α</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"des\">ος, ον</span> :\nqui a lieu <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> vient à temps, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">propr.</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec idée de temps,</span>\nopportun, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1,\n125 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Att.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Sept.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">El.</span> <span class=\"refch\">598,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) ; <span class=\"grec\">καίριον λέγειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Ant.</span> <span class=\"refch\">724,</span>\nparler à propos, dire des choses opportunes ; <span class=\"grec\">τὰ\nκαίρια,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4,\n10,</span> les circonstances favorables, l’opportunité ;\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de pers. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">καιρίαν δ’ ἡμῖν ὁρῶ στείχουσαν Ἰοκάστην,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.R.</span> <span class=\"refch\">631,</span> voici que justement je vois Jocaste s’avancer\nvers nous ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\nanal.</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec idée de lieu,</span> qui se\ntrouve à l’endroit convenable (<span class=\"ital\">particul.</span>\npour donner la mort): <span class=\"grec\">ἐν καιρίῳ,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 185 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">κατὰ καίριον,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 439,</span> à l’endroit où\nle coup est mortel ; <span class=\"grec\">τὰ καίρια</spa